<chapter xml:id="anova">
  <title>ANOVA</title>
  <section xml:id="anova-regression">
    <title>ANOVA and regression are connected</title>
    <p>Analysis of variance can be understood inside the linear-model framework. Categorical predictors become indicator variables and the model compares systematic between-group differences with unexplained within-group variation.</p>
  </section>
</chapter>
